window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-13f43bd2cc842afb"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"complete-tasks-from-messages\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">根据消息完成任务</h1> <p>读取 iMessage 对话，并在相关应用中完成后续工作。</p> <p>使用 Computer Use 阅读一条 Messages 对话、完成任务，并起草回复。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>消息中包含明确请求、后续事项或预订任务的情况。</li> <li>需要快速查看 Messages 和少数几个相关应用才能完成的工作。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">起步提示词</h2> <p>完成消息线程中的一项任务</p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer 查看我与 [person] 的消息。\n\n然后：\n\n- 理解对方的请求\n\n- 在相关应用中完成这项任务\n\n- 在同一条对话中起草回复\n\n对于下单或确认预订等不可逆操作，请先停下来询问我。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">Computer Use</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2645e597941a2d38\">自定义 ChatGPT</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"introduction\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">简介</h2> <p>许多消息对话中都隐含着待办事项：预订晚餐、安排后续跟进、研究选项、提交收据，或整理回复所需的信息。Computer Use 可以阅读对话、找出需要完成的任务，并在相关应用之间协助完成后续工作。</p> <p>如果消息中包含明确请求，并且你希望 ChatGPT 继续处理后续事项，而不只是概述对话，那么这种方式就很适合。</p> <p><a id=\"how-to-use\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">使用方法</h2> <ol> <li>安装 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/computer-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Computer Use 插件（本地尚未收录）</a>。</li> <li>让 ChatGPT 查看指定的消息对话或发件人。</li> <li>说明要采取什么操作，以及在完成哪些操作之前是否需要暂停并询问你。</li> <li>指明是否要在原始对话中起草回复。</li> </ol> <p>例如：</p> <ul> <li><code>@Computer Look at my messages from [person]. Check my availability, find 2 dinner options in Hayes Valley, and draft a reply in the same thread. Check in with me before completing booking.</code></li> </ul> <p><a id=\"practical-tips\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">实用技巧</h2> <p><a id=\"ask-for-a-pause-before-irreversible-actions\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_8\">对不可逆操作要求先暂停</h3> <p>如果任务可能涉及转账、下单、确认预订或最终敲定日程，请明确要求 ChatGPT 在执行最后一步之前停下来征求你的同意。</p> <p><a id=\"make-sure-the-supporting-apps-are-ready\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_9\">确保相关应用已准备就绪</h3> <p>相关应用已登录且可以使用时，效果最好。如果任务依赖 Maps、Calendar、Notes、预订网站或浏览器会话，请提前准备好这些应用。</p> <p><a id=\"expect-the-thread-to-be-marked-as-read\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_10\">预期该对话会被标记为已读</h3> <p>ChatGPT 在 Messages 中打开对话时，操作方式与普通用户查看对话类似。因此请将该对话视为已读。</p> <p><a id=\"good-follow-ups\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_11\">可以继续尝试的场景</h2> <p>同样的模式也适用于其他以收件箱为起点的界面，例如 Slack 或电子邮件：工作从一条消息开始，最终在其他地方完成。如果你经常使用此类流程，可以在<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/customization/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">自定义设置（本地尚未收录）</a>中添加可重复使用的偏好或指令，让 ChatGPT 每次都以相同方式处理请求。</p> <p><a id=\"suggested-prompt\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_12\">建议提示词</h3> <p><strong>完成消息线程中的一项任务</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Look at my messages from [person].\n\nThen:\n\n- understand the request\n- complete the task across the apps involved\n- draft a reply in the same thread\n\nPause before anything irreversible, such as placing an order or confirming a booking.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Computer 查看 [person] 发给我的消息。\n\n然后：\n\n- 理解请求\n- 在涉及的各个应用之间完成任务\n- 在同一个讨论串中起草回复\n\n在执行下单、确认预订等任何不可逆操作之前暂停。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"complete-tasks-from-messages\">Complete tasks from messages</h1> <p>Turn iMessage threads into completed work across the apps involved.</p> <p>Use Computer Use to read one Messages thread, complete the task, and draft a reply.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Message threads that contain a concrete request, follow-up, or booking task</li> <li>Work that needs a quick check across Messages plus a few related apps</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Finish One Task From a Message Thread</p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Look at my messages from [person].\n\nThen:\n- understand the request\n- complete the task across the apps involved\n- draft a reply in the same thread\n\nPause before anything irreversible, such as placing an order or confirming a booking.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">Computer Use</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2645e597941a2d38\">Customize ChatGPT</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"introduction\">Introduction</h2> <p>Many message threads contain hidden to-dos: book dinner, schedule a follow-up, research options, submit a receipt, or pull together information for a reply. Computer Use can help by reading the thread, identifying the task, and completing the work across the apps involved.</p> <p>This is a good fit when the message contains a concrete request and you want ChatGPT to handle the follow-through, not just summarize the thread.</p> <h2 id=\"how-to-use\">How to use</h2> <ol> <li>Install the <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/computer-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Computer Use plugin (not in this local snapshot)</a>.</li> <li>Ask ChatGPT to review a specific message thread or sender.</li> <li>Tell it what action to take and whether it should pause before completing anything.</li> <li>Specify whether it should draft a reply in the original thread.</li> </ol> <p>For example:</p> <ul> <li><code>@Computer Look at my messages from [person]. Check my availability, find 2 dinner options in Hayes Valley, and draft a reply in the same thread. Check in with me before completing booking.</code></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"practical-tips\">Practical tips</h2> <h3 id=\"ask-for-a-pause-before-irreversible-actions\">Ask for a pause before irreversible actions</h3> <p>If the task might send money, submit an order, confirm a booking, or finalize a schedule, tell ChatGPT to stop and ask before taking that last step.</p> <h3 id=\"make-sure-the-supporting-apps-are-ready\">Make sure the supporting apps are ready</h3> <p>This works best when the related apps are already signed in and available. If the task depends on Maps, Calendar, Notes, a reservation site, or a browser session, prepare those ahead of time.</p> <h3 id=\"expect-the-thread-to-be-marked-as-read\">Expect the thread to be marked as read</h3> <p>When ChatGPT opens the thread in Messages, it will behave like a normal user viewing the conversation. Treat that as a read.</p> <h2 id=\"good-follow-ups\">Good follow-ups</h2> <p>This same pattern can work for other inbox-style surfaces too, such as Slack or email, when the work starts from a message and finishes somewhere else. If the workflow becomes common, add a reusable preference or instruction in <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/customization/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">customization (not in this local snapshot)</a> so ChatGPT handles those requests the same way every time.</p> <h3 id=\"suggested-prompt\">Suggested prompt</h3> <p><strong>Finish One Task From a Message Thread</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Look at my messages from [person].\n\nThen:\n\n- understand the request\n- complete the task across the apps involved\n- draft a reply in the same thread\n\nPause before anything irreversible, such as placing an order or confirming a booking.\n</code></pre>"};
